<title>UK: State Bank NSW sets A$210 million eight-year FRN.</title>
<headline>State Bank NSW sets A$210 million eight-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by sole manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE BANK OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GOVERNOR OF THE STATE OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT	  A$210 MLN SPREAD     +16 BP    MATURITY    10.SEP.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE  3M BANK BILLS  PAY DATE    30.SEP.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   ISS PRICE  99.939    FULL FEES   0.30</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 5-50-250  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIP     NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
